    "description": "BRAND NEW ARRIVAL * ONLY 90,0000 MILES * BOX TRUCK *\n\n2018 International 4300 – 26’ Box Truck • High Cube • Anthony Railgate • Only 90K Miles\nFamily Owned • Over 30 Years in Business\n One Owner • Fleet Maintained • Never from Auction\nCall: 407-321-4244 | Text: 407-212-6120\n2018 International 4300\nOnly 90,000 Original Miles\n Power Windows | Power Locks | Heated Mirrors\n Cruise Control\n LED Lights\n Absolutely No Rust\n Super Clean\n One Owner | Fleet Maintained\n Low Miles for the Year\n26’ x 102” x 103” High Cube Dry Van Body\n No Leaks | No Cracks\n Large 4,500 lb Anthony Railgate\n (Can Be Removed If Not Needed and Swapped Out for a DOT Bumper)\nBrand New Arrival | Turnkey Fleet-Ready Box Truck\nPreventive maintenance always performed on schedule – Turnkey Fleet-Ready Box Truck\nLocated in Sanford/Orlando, FL\n Nationwide Delivery and Flexible Financing Available\nVisit: www.UsedTruckBodies.com\nWe stock and build 10'–26' dry vans, refrigerated boxes, dump bodies, flatbeds, liftgates, and railgates. On-site fabrication, installation, repair, and nationwide delivery available.\n\"Don't waste your time with the rest, come straight to the best!\" – DeBary Truck Sales\nFollow us on Instagram and Facebook: @DeBaryTruckSales\nDeBary Truck Sales in Sanford, Florida offers a huge selection of commercial trucks from top manufacturers including Freightliner, International, Kenworth, Hino, Mack, Ford, Isuzu, GMC, Chevrolet, Volvo, Mitsubishi Fuso, Peterbilt, Sterling, UD, and Western Star. We specialize in light duty, medium duty, and heavy duty work trucks including box trucks, landscape trucks, gutter and HVAC trucks, moving trucks, bread trucks, route delivery trucks, stepvans, cargo vans, dump trucks, flatbeds, hooklift trucks, roll-off trucks, bucket trucks, service utility trucks, cab and chassis units, yard spotters, day cabs, sleepers, and tow trucks. We stock diesel and gas models including NPR, NQR, and NRR series, non-CDL options, sin